================================================================================
LANGUAGE DATA
================================================================================

The language data files are NOT covered by the Apache License above. They are
derived from Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike sources and are therefore
distributed under CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/),
with attribution as set out below. This applies to:

  app/src/main/db/*WordsRaw.txt, app/src/main/db/*RegionTags.txt,
  the generated *Db.db assets, and the published language packs.

English (app/src/main/db/EnglishWordsRaw.txt)
  - Word frequencies: hermitdave/FrequencyWords, OpenSubtitles 2018 en_full
    (CC BY-SA 4.0) — https://github.com/hermitdave/FrequencyWords
  - Vocabulary inventory: English Wiktionary via Kaikki wiktextract
    (CC BY-SA 4.0) — Wiktionary contributors; wiktextract by Tatu Ylonen
  - Part-of-speech tags and capitalization statistics: derived from English
    Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0) — Wikipedia contributors — using spaCy (MIT).

English regional variants (app/src/main/db/EnglishRegionTags.txt)
  - British/American spelling and vocabulary skew: English Wiktionary via Kaikki
    wiktextract (CC BY-SA 4.0)

Word-exclusion lists (app/src/main/db/*WordsAvoid.txt, build-time only — never shipped)
  - LDNOOBW, List of Dirty, Naughty, Obscene and Otherwise Bad Words (CC BY 4.0)
  - coffee-and-fun/google-profanity-words (MIT)
  - words/cuss (MIT)
  - 4troDev/profanity.csv (MIT)
  - Wiktionary sense tags and slur categories via Kaikki wiktextract (CC BY-SA 4.0)

Español (app/src/main/db/EspanolWordsRaw.txt, EspanolRegionTags.txt)
  - Word frequencies: hermitdave/FrequencyWords, OpenSubtitles 2016 es_full
    (CC BY-SA 4.0)
  - Capitalization statistics: Spanish Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)
  - Regional skew tags: Spanish Wiktionary via Kaikki wiktextract (CC BY-SA 4.0)

Tiếng Việt (app/src/main/db/TiengVietWordsRaw.txt)
  - Syllable frequencies: hermitdave/FrequencyWords, OpenSubtitles 2018 vi
    (CC BY-SA 4.0)
  - Tail counts and capitalization statistics: Vietnamese Wikipedia
    (CC BY-SA 4.0)
  - Multi-syllable unit inventory and canonical orthography
    (TiengVietUnits.txt): Vietnamese Wiktionary via Kaikki wiktextract
    (CC BY-SA 4.0) — Wiktionary contributors
  - N-gram and unit counts (TiengVietNgb.txt): HPLT v2 vie_Latn web corpus
    (CC0)

